graph TD
    %% User Interaction Layer
    A[User] -->|Interact| B(Streamlit UI)
    B -->|API Call| C(FastAPI API)
    
    %% Inference Service Layer
    C -->|Model Inference| D(KFServing: Taxi Prediction Model)
    C -->|Feature Retrieval| F(Feast: Online Store Redis)
    C -->|Model Management| T(MLflow: Model Registry)
    C -->|Stream Processing| G(Kafka: Message Queue)
    
    %% Feature Store Layer
    F -->|Feature Service| D
    O(Feast: Offline Store Parquet) -->|Feature Materialization| F
    
    %% Core Training Pipeline (TFX Pipeline)
    G -->|Data Ingestion| H(TFX Pipeline)
    H --> H1[Apache Beam: Distributed Execution Engine]
    H1 --> I[ExampleGen: Data Ingestion]
    I --> J[StatisticsGen: Data Statistics]
    J --> K[SchemaGen: Schema Generation]
    K --> L[ExampleValidator: Data Validation]
    L --> M[Transform: Feature Transformation]
    M --> P[Trainer: Model Training]
    P --> R[Evaluator: Model Evaluation]
    R --> S[Pusher: Model Deployment]
    
    %% Independent Feast Integration Pipeline (Best Practice)
    M -->|Transformed Data| Z[Feast Integration Pipeline]
    Z -->|Feature Engineering| AA[Feature Processing]
    AA -->|Batch Write| O
    AA -->|Real-time Materialization| F
    Z -->|Scheduling Management| BB[Feast Scheduler]
    
    %% Model Management and Deployment
    P -->|Model Registration| T
    S -->|Model Deployment| D
    T -->|Model Version| D
    
    %% Data Version and Metadata Management
    I -->|Data Version| U(DVC: Data Version Control)
    H -->|Execution Metadata| V(MLMD: Metadata Store)
    T -->|Model Metadata| V
    
    %% Real-time Data Stream
    G -->|Real-time Features| CC[Stream Processor]
    CC -->|Feature Update| F
    G -->|Model Metrics| DD[Metrics Collector]
    DD -->|Performance Monitoring| W
    
    %% Data Quality Monitoring
    L -->|Data Quality| EE[Data Drift Monitor]
    EE -->|Drift Detection| B
    EE -->|Alert| X
    
    %% Monitoring and Observability
    C -->|API Metrics| W(Prometheus: Metrics Collection)
    C -->|Application Logs| X(Loki: Log Aggregation)
    G -->|Kafka Logs| X
    H -->|Pipeline Logs| X
    Z -->|Feast Logs| X
    W -->|Metrics Visualization| Y(Grafana: Monitoring Dashboard)
    X -->|Log Query| Y
    Y -->|Alert| FF[Alert Manager]
    
